      prompt: "Order a bypass pumping plan for a planned trunk sewer repair.",
      topicId: "emergency-overflow-programs",
      level: "class1",
      assumptions: "Fictional western Canadian wastewater collection scenario for Class 3 study. Conditions are as stated in the configuration, and all work follows site procedures, provincial wastewater requirements in general terms, the federal Wastewater Systems Effluent Regulations and the CCME Canada-wide Strategy as general references, and standard collection practice.",
